{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-04-23 07:30:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ANNOUNCES FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'DALLAS, APRIL 23, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) TODAY REPORTED FIRST QUARTER 2021 RESULTS. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY FIRST QUARTER 2021 NET SALES OF $4.7 BILLION DECREASED 5 PERCENT COMPARED TO THE YEAR-AGO PERIOD, INCLUDING AN ORGANIC SALES DECLINE OF 8 PERCENT.'}